BDEPEND=app-misc/jq
DEFINED_PHASES=info install setup unpack
DESCRIPTION=FaceGaze is an accessibility feature on ChromeOS that allows users to move the mouse with their forehead and perform clicks/keyboard actions with facial gestures. The FaceGaze feature relies on the mediapipe FaceLandmarker API to detect forehead position and facial gestures of the user. This DLC packages the FaceLandmarker ML model and the mediapipe web assembly required to run the FaceLandmarker API in JavaScript.
